      "describe_ch": "儒家思想講「親親、仁民、愛物」；道家思想講「常善救人，故無棄人；常善救物，故無棄物。」這是最符合永續經營的生命智慧。",
      "describe_en": "Confucianism says \"close relatives, be kind to the people, and love things\"; Taoism says, \"Always be good at saving people, so no one will be abandoned; always be good at saving things, so there will be no abandonment.\" This is the wisdom of life that is most in line with sustainable management.",
      "core_id": "C",
      "core_item": "溝通技巧：能具備清楚表達的能力；能理解他人口語與非口語的訊息；能建立良好的人際關係。",
      "core_eng": "Communication Skills：To be equipped with the skills of effective verbal and non-verbal  interaction  and team work communication.",
      "core_level": "2 ",
