    {
      "yms_year": 114.0,
      "yms_smester": 2.0,
      "cls_id": "XC04111",
      "sub_id": "GH251",
      "scr_dup": "001",
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "人人的「性」相同，故有教無類；人人的「命」不同，故因材施教。我們不是跟他人比高低，而是跟自己比進步與否，明乎此，就不會怨天尤人，才能提升身心靈的健康。",
      "describe_en": "Everyone's \"nature\" is the same, so there is no difference in teaching; everyone's \"destiny\" is different, so we should teach students according to their aptitude. We are not comparing ourselves with others, but comparing ourselves with ourselves. Only when we understand this, we will not blame others and will improve our physical and mental health.",
      "core_id": "F",
      "core_item": "公民實踐：能關注社會問題；能重視人與環境之和諧；能參與公民社會活動。",
      "core_eng": "Global Citizenship：To be equipped with humanistic sentiments toward the care of social and natural environment; conduct life-long learning, civic responsibility and serve the public .",
      "core_level": "2 ",
